{"key":"Passives_Abnormality-exme.json|/dataList/14/desc","kr_sha":"1736aa743f600a13c6387fa2d8e4b67061fdff4b9b18fb055d08dd014f68eb16","zh":"回合開始時，使以下效果生效：\n- 自身處於 [ChoiSwordsmanshipOne] 時，若自身的 [ChoiSwordsmanship] 層數低於5層：\n對自身施加(5 - [ChoiSwordsmanship] 層數)層的<color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>[Vulnerable]</color></mark></b></u>\n- 自身處於 [ChoiSwordsmanshipMany] 時，若自身的 [ChoiSwordsmanship] 層數高於5層：\n根據超出的層數，對自身施加等數的<color=#ff6000><mark color=#ff000040><b><u>[Vulnerable]</color></mark></b></u>層數","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"1abf727030de68c4fabfa4fbb265fb1f2a59cfbb","model":"phase1-session","batch":"20261101T081709-3f1b4885"}
